    "title": "DOP Fun: Delete One Part",
    "description": "Are you smart enough? Then delete one part!\r\n\r\nFind the wrong part. Delete one part. Challenge your brain with DOP game.\r\n\r\nDownload this awesome tricky brain DOP game and use logic to solve puzzles!\r\n\r\n\r\nLet's find the wrong part, and delete one part to check how smart you are! Test your brain! Just delete the wrong part to solve this awesome erase deleting DOP puzzle!\r\n\r\nDOP Fun: Delete One Part is an awesome unique tricky puzzle and erase DOP game that combines both funny situations and creativity. It's time for you to bring out your inner artist! Download DOP Fun: Delete One Part for free now!\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\r\n- The rule is simple: Find the wrong part.Touch the screen and drag your finger to erase part of the drawing and see what lies behind it.\r\n\r\n- Think outside the box.\r\n\r\n- Click Hint button whenever you need hints.\r\n\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n\r\n- Over 100 levels to quench your thirst for DOP deleting and erase\r\n\r\n- Unlimited brain-out delete puzzles for your imagination to run wild.\r\n\r\n- Smooth and addictive DOP game.\r\n\r\n- Immerse yourself in the wonderful world of DOP deleting erase!\r\n\r\n\r\nAre you ready to draw, brain out, resolve a tricky DOP puzzle ? Download DOP Fun: Delete One Part and find out now!",
